    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749130/extras/84d1b140b22f09ae84f8c6709488c555.avif?t=1753527548\" width=714 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fusion of deck-building roguelike and tower defense returns, bigger than ever!</strong> Build your deck with powerful new cards, unlock unique trinkets, and deploy enhanced towers to overcome relentless waves of enemies and new strategic challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map Editor and Steam Workshop</strong>: Create your own maps and share them with the world on Steam Workshop, and download the ones you like made by the community!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller support</strong>: Tower Tactics 2 was designed with controller and Steam Deck support in mind!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New mechanics</strong>: Hero cards, powerful temporary effects, card items, new status effects like Burn, Poison and Frail, new combat types, new enemy abilities and much more!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced metaprogression</strong>: Collect dozens of decks and improve them between runs in multiple new ways!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of new content</strong>: New cards, enemies, tiles, decks, game modes, maps, trinkets...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New challenges await</strong>: Will you be able to succeed in the new Sector 4? Sounds challenging, but you will have new tools at your disposal!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More information will be revealed as development continues.\u00a0<strong>Be sure to wishlist the game now to not miss it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coming to Early Access!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback is key to making Tower Tactics 2 even better, which is why we're launching in Early Access!\u00a0Join the conversation, share your ideas, and help shape the future of the game on the <strong>Steam Forums</strong> and the\u00a0<strong>official Discord server</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749130/extras/84d1b140b22f09ae84f8c6709488c555.avif?t=1753527548\" width=714 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fusion of deck-building roguelike and tower defense returns, bigger than ever!</strong> Build your deck with powerful new cards, unlock unique trinkets, and deploy enhanced towers to overcome relentless waves of enemies and new strategic challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map Editor and Steam Workshop</strong>: Create your own maps and share them with the world on Steam Workshop, and download the ones you like made by the community!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller support</strong>: Tower Tactics 2 was designed with controller and Steam Deck support in mind!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New mechanics</strong>: Hero cards, powerful temporary effects, card items, new status effects like Burn, Poison and Frail, new combat types, new enemy abilities and much more!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced metaprogression</strong>: Collect dozens of decks and improve them between runs in multiple new ways!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of new content</strong>: New cards, enemies, tiles, decks, game modes, maps, trinkets...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New challenges await</strong>: Will you be able to succeed in the new Sector 4? Sounds challenging, but you will have new tools at your disposal!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More information will be revealed as development continues.\u00a0<strong>Be sure to wishlist the game now to not miss it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coming to Early Access!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback is key to making Tower Tactics 2 even better, which is why we're launching in Early Access!\u00a0Join the conversation, share your ideas, and help shape the future of the game on the <strong>Steam Forums</strong> and the\u00a0<strong>official Discord server</strong>!</p>",
